on Slayer\nDetailed maps\nDark fantasy atmosphere\nDesigned for anime and RPG fans\n\n","path":"/game/113829431520841-slayerbound","slug":"113829431520841-slayerbound","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/25c8fc567582d0a72242ffe5e4d7b5a7487b0bb6eca99fe97dc043caf2da872d.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9f178c50aa3248c6e6b5b89b682fa789/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":3376096,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-02-09T02:07:45.404Z","creator":{"name":"MiraiInc.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":140270923132362,"name":"Tiny Empires [WORLD 2]","desc":"👑 Tiny Empires - Kingdom Builder\n\nBuild your kingdom from nothing! Start with an empty plot and grow into a powerful empire. Will you become a peaceful farmer or a conquering warlord?\n\n⭐ FEATURES:\n• Build houses, farms, mines, and military barracks\n• Train armies and send them to battle\n• Capture zones and fight other players for control\n• Harvest resources and sell them for gold\n• Level up and unlock bigger buildings\n• Compete against up to 5 other players\n• Buildings build offline!\n\n💰 GROW YOUR ECONOMY:\nAssign workers to your farms and mines. Sell resources for gold. Expand your land and upgrade from tents to castles!\n\n⚔️ CONQUER THE REALM:\nTrain troops and capture zones for permanent bonuses. The strongest kingdom rules the server!\n\nYour empire awaits. Start building now!\n\nThis game is in Beta. Expect bugs.","path":"/game/140270923132362-tiny-empires","slug":"140270923132362-tiny-empires","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/67071763cb48c7f3de8a970e4a5b71370ce3a7e98ee82b9484483346d0c9f889.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-907bc60837342246e9dbdb5a54027eb9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":3,"visitor":10528119,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-07T17:54:06.334Z","creator":{"name":"Factory Limited","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}}],"t